	(text "Per device: Ron/Roff, 0.5R Kelvin R to the COM star, 10k and Zeners (about +21 V / -5.7 V) on its own Kelvin net.\nMiller hold: N-MOSFET clamp (PMV30ENEA) gate-pin to a local VEE (1u on the Kelvin pin). LAYOUT: FET + 1u at the device, loop <= 1 nH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.76 180.924 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "01b0ee03-2e90-5262-85b4-9e0820b3eca7")
	)
	(text "2 x ZXTP25040DFH emitter followers on OUTL (B-E 1k, C to VEE): each sinks the Roff current of 3 gates;\nthe NSI6651 supplies base current only. Turn-on stays on OUTH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 449.747 73.152 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "18a98a17-c29d-51b4-9e33-acedc7702a7d")
	)
	(text "BH: MILLER CLAMP CONTROL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 193.424 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1eb93b13-0b26-55df-86a4-bf756e8c039f")
	)
	(text "DESAT pin (internal 500 uA blanking source, trip 8.5-10.0 V) - Rs - 2 x US1M - drain.\nBAT54S keeps DX between COM and VDD against dv/dt through the string; Cblk footprint DNP."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 244.85 276.836 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "296ec122-60c6-5215-bd81-b6256a2fdb7f")
	)
	(text "MMBT3906 inverter (E COM, base BAT54+2.2k on CLAMP) drives CG to COM once the lowest gate is below ~-1.2 V;\nMMBT3904 release (from OUTH via 5.6 V Zener) holds CG at VEE while OUTH drives."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 283.712 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "623fc860-6135-5201-b1f4-83ebc3a1572d")
	)
	(text "DESAT > 10.3-10.9 V (above the 10.0 V maximum trip of the -Q1 grade) -> MMBT3904 -> MMBT3906 charges BG to VEE + 10 V;\nper device AO3400A + 22R pull the gate to VEE; BG holds ~3 us (1k + FET gates)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.222 269.348 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "77a3eabb-00fc-52b0-9d35-57006e51b3fb")
	)
